Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: vibeos
Upstream-Contact: pulpoff <pashkovsky@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/pulpoff/vibeos
Comment:
 The apps are rebuilds of LineageOS/AOSP apps (Dialer, Messaging, DeskClock,
 Etar, ExactCalculator) and the shell follows SystemUI and Launcher3; their
 icons, images and data tables are converted from those Apache-2.0 sources.
 .
 No sound files from Android are shipped: vibeos-clock's and vibeos-messaging's
 own sounds are links into the freedesktop sound theme.

