Files: apps/dictate/src/dictate-ru.c
       apps/dictate/src/dictate-ru.h
       apps/dictate/src/dictate-ru-*.c
       apps/dictate/src/dictate-ru-private.h
Copyright: 2026 Evgeniy Chetvertkov (tiny-voca-ru)
           2026 Muhammed Nazeem (tiny-voca)
           2026 pulpoff <pashkovsky@gmail.com> (the port to C)
License: Apache-2.0
Comment:
 A port to C of tiny-voca-ru's Russian text front end (src/tiny_voca_ru/
 frontend of https://github.com/yilbegan/tiny-voca-ru, version 0.2.1): its
 normalisation, stress placement, rules from letters to phones and tokens,
 with its tables. Its NOTICE: tiny-voca-ru is based on tiny-voca, Copyright
 2026 Muhammed Nazeem, https://github.com/n4ze3m/tiny-voca, Apache License
 2.0; its stress dictionary, accent model, homograph vocabulary and homograph
 model are derived from ruaccent (https://github.com/Den4ikAI/ruaccent), MIT
 License. No model or data is in this package: the voice (egnch/tiny-voca-ru
 on Hugging Face) and ruaccent's data are downloaded in the app, with their
 licences beside them.

Files: extension/keyboard/layouts/*
       extension/keyboard/icondata.js
       tools/latinime-dump
Copyright: 2008 The Android Open Source Project
           The LineageOS Project
           Google LLC (Material Symbols)
           2026 pulpoff <pashkovsky@gmail.com>
License: Apache-2.0
Comment:
 NOTICE: the on-screen keyboard's layouts and sizes (layouts/*.json) are
 generated by tools/latinime-dump from LatinIME, the AOSP keyboard, as
 LineageOS ships it (lineage-23.2 and lineage-24.0): its layout XML, its key
 texts table and its dimension resources. Its icons (icondata.js) are
 converted by extension/tools/vd2js.py from the same tree's vector drawables
 (Material Symbols) and from frameworks/base core's ic_ime_nav_back and
 ic_ime_switcher. LatinIME's NOTICE: "Copyright (c) 2008, The Android Open
 Source Project. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0";
 layouts/NOTICE repeats it. No Google keyboard (Gboard), voice typing or
 proprietary gesture-typing code or data is included.

Files: extension/keyboard/words/*
       tools/latinime-words
Copyright: 2008 The Android Open Source Project
           The LineageOS Project
           Tatoeba contributors (https://tatoeba.org)
           2026 pulpoff <pashkovsky@gmail.com>
License: Apache-2.0 and CC-BY-2.0-FR
Comment:
 NOTICE: the keyboard's word lists (<locale>.txt.gz) are generated by
 tools/latinime-words from LatinIME, the AOSP keyboard, as LineageOS ships it
 (lineage-23.2): its dictionaries' *.combined.gz word lists and whitelist
 corrections (Apache-2.0). Their next-word part counts which word follows which
 in Tatoeba's sentences (CC BY 2.0 FR); only the counts are kept. words/NOTICE
 repeats both notices.

Files: libtonal/*
Copyright: 2021-2025 Google LLC
           2026 pulpoff <pashkovsky@gmail.com>
License: Apache-2.0
Comment:
 NOTICE: libtonal is a port to C of Google's Material Color Utilities
 (https://github.com/material-foundation/material-color-utilities, Java
 sources as of 194144d75ed7, Copyright 2021-2025 Google LLC, Apache-2.0):
 HCT and CAM16, tonal palettes, the dynamic schemes with their variants and
 contrast levels, the Wu and weighted k-means quantizers and Score. The
 upstream project ships no NOTICE file. Each libtonal source file carries an
 SPDX Apache-2.0 header; the C port is under the same licence.

